# Target repository: frameworks/base
# Clean-Room Implementation: Gaming Lade-Bypass & Touch Game-Mode (MODE_GAME)
# Saves and restores full charging mode, limit, and enabled state via HealthInterface.
# Dynamic ContentObserver enables instant toggle during active game sessions.
# Automatically toggles /proc/touchpanel/game_switch_enable (MODE_GAME).
# The charging state before bypass is kept in Settings.Global and restored at boot
# (or before the next bypass) if a game session was interrupted by a reboot.
#
# Setter acknowledgements and settings readback are checked; this is not a hardware-current measurement.
# Failed restoration retains its recovery record and blocks a new bypass session.
# Settings.System bypass_charge_limit: 0 = game-start level (minimum 70), 70..100 = fixed limit.
